// # Lanelet OSM XML Parser & GeoTIFF Stubs
//
// Logline: Provides fail-closed security stubs for OpenStreetMap XML map parsers and GeoTIFF rendering.
//
// Setup: Requires SysCap capability; fails closed on unsupported native lanelet FFI.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Guard OpenStreetMap (OSM) XML HD map file parsing FFI.
//   2. Guard GPU canvas map rendering and vector rasterization pipelines.
//   3. Enforce fail-closed termination for unverified map routing drivers.

